{"id": "EUVD-2026-84118", "enisaUuid": "8f929b98-4917-33d8-adb3-191ac8cba3ad", "description": "In OpenStack Octavia before 18.0.1, the Amphora provider driver did not validate the listener and pool tls_ciphers field for control characters. The value is written verbatim into the HAProxy configuration generated on the amphora, and thus an authenticated project member who owns a TLS-enabled load balancer can embed a newline and inject arbitrary HAProxy configuration directives. Only deployments using the Amphora provider are affected.", "datePublished": "2026-09-21T20:13:35", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-24T22:41:15", "baseScore": 9.4, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:H/SI:H/SA:H", "references": ["https://bugs.launchpad.net/octavia/+bug/2162101", "https://bugs.launchpad.net/octavia/+bug/2167565", "https://bugs.debian.org/1148175", "https://opendev.org/openstack/octavia/commit/cad62902e4984a46ad80cbfa943e90006d8d599d", "https://security.openstack.org/ossa/OSSA-2026-039.html", "https://openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/09/21/6"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-94572", "GHSA-xwpf-r3rp-gx2r"], "assigner": "mitre", "epss": 0.53, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "6336aa94-6541-34f4-abb6-8a41b9bbea51", "product": {"name": "Octavia", "vendor": {"name": "OpenStack"}}, "product_version": "17.0.0 <17.0.1"}, {"id": "a42d045a-bfdf-359c-9118-113060429c31", "product": {"name": "Octavia", "vendor": {"name": "OpenStack"}}, "product_version": "18.0.0 <18.0.1"}, {"id": "b487c7b0-63b4-3f0a-833b-874513eebd88", "product": {"name": "Octavia", "vendor": {"name": "OpenStack"}}, "product_version": "6.0.0 <16.1.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "8d097cf2-d6f5-3aca-a0e9-382e538dacad", "vendor": {"name": "OpenStack"}}], "isExploited": false}